Description:  flashprog identifies, reads, writes, verifies and erases flash chips over
 SPI, LPC, FWH and parallel buses. This package is offered to OpenWrt in
 https://github.com/openwrt/packages/issues/29591 and carries a name of its
 own until that is settled. It installs the same paths as the package under
 review, so it conflicts with it.
 
